description: "> A quote with no marker stays text.\n\n>\n> [!hook] on the second line of a quote is no marker.\n\n> [link] [!hook] in the middle of a line is no marker.\n\n> [!not a word] stays text too.\n\n> \\[!hook] stays text: the escape keeps the brackets.\n\n> \\[!tip] stays text too, though tip is no callout.\n\n> &#91;!hook] stays text: an entity is no marker.\n\n> [!hoo&#107;] stays text for the same reason.\n"
