title: (none)

text 726a49ad2bf7
<blockquote><p>A quote with no marker stays text.</p></blockquote>
<blockquote><p>[!hook] on the second line of a quote is no marker.</p></blockquote>
<blockquote><p>[link] [!hook] in the middle of a line is no marker.</p></blockquote>
<blockquote><p>[!not a word] stays text too.</p></blockquote>
<blockquote><p>[!hook] stays text: the escape keeps the brackets.</p></blockquote>
<blockquote><p>[!tip] stays text too, though tip is no callout.</p></blockquote>
<blockquote><p>[!hook] stays text: an entity is no marker.</p></blockquote>
<blockquote><p>[!hook] stays text for the same reason.</p></blockquote>
